{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日早些時候，微軟旗下服務出現大範圍中斷，Xbox Live、Outlook等產品全線無法正常使用。與此同時，美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）宣佈全美航班暫停起飛，等待後續通知。這家科技巨頭明確表示，兩起事件完全沒有關聯。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586410.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.845640+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:27:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_hash":"e383cf0892ef050aca87d666c4dc81d5057425ad0bfe2432529b5553ccfbcb23","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}